  "summary": "The executor contract exposes printMoney(), selector 0x94655f2b, with no caller check. It forwards caller-supplied token, amount and recipient words to the paired holder contract 0xb5cb0555a1d28c9dfdbc14017dae131d5c1cc19c, which trusts the executor as its only authorised caller, so anyone could transfer the holder\u2019s balances anywhere. The attacker called it seven times in one transaction and swept the holder\u2019s WBNB, ETH, USDT, TUSD, BTCB, USDC and FDUSD.",
