    "confidence": "high",
    "notes": "Components are the holder contract\u2019s net ERC-20 deltas in the single exploit transaction, and they match the attacker\u2019s net gain token for token. The v1 snapshot carried USD 2,000,000 for this row; that figure is not supported on chain. The holder held 22.49 WBNB, 1.51 ETH, 0.032 BTCB and about 13,500 in stablecoins at the exploit block, which is the entirety of what left. Stablecoin components use par; the largest DefiLlama deviation from par among them at the incident timestamp is 0.13 percent. The attacker EOA is a serial exploiter with 72 transactions, but only this one touches this victim. Nothing was recovered."
